WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.513
Welcome to the Blue Team Facilitator orientation.

00:00:03.513 --> 00:00:06.650
Guide Blue Team's discussion, review the Scribe handoff,

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.238
project the working record, and submit the final team

00:00:09.238 --> 00:00:10.963
artifact to White Cell.

00:00:10.963 --> 00:00:14.037
Your workflow moves from framing the discussion, to reviewing

00:00:14.037 --> 00:00:16.962
the Scribe’s record, to projecting and submitting the agreed

00:00:16.962 --> 00:00:18.038
artifact.

00:00:18.038 --> 00:00:22.275
Keep presentation, editing, and submission as separate decisions

00:00:22.275 --> 00:00:22.413
.

00:00:22.413 --> 00:00:25.663
The team remains responsible for its judgment, while White

00:00:25.663 --> 00:00:28.125
Cell remains responsible for review.
